target/
# Cargo.lock is NOT ignored: both the root lockfile and
# crates/ruviz-gpui/Cargo.lock are committed on purpose. `cargo publish
# --locked` and scripts/verify_packaged_crates.py both read them, and the
# publish gate asserts the root lockfile carries no `git+` source.
